          "n": "1",
          "text": "She is away from her desk at the moment."
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "The connection seems to be very bad."
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "I'll hang up and call again."
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Would you mind if I ask a few questions about Korean customs?"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "No, I don t. Go ahead."
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Can you speak up, please?"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I can hardly hear you."
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "What time do you start your day?"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Let's call it a day."
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Do you have time?"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Do you have the time?"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "What's the date today?"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "What day is today?"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "What's the occasion?"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "What are we celebrating?"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Why are we eating out at this expensive restaurant?"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "Today is our tenth wedding anniversary."
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "How time flies!"
        },
        {
